Z||000000||Fatal Error||08-02-2001||01:46 AM||||Does anyone know of a kit or how much I am looking at to rebuild the lower half of an I4 2.5l? It's only got 65k miles on it, from what I understand it is the result of poor maintenance. It has a rod bearing going out. While I have it apart would anyone have any suggestions as to what (if any) mods I should do? bore it over at all? Give that lil' iron duke a lil' more pep  ... Thanks guys!<BR>-Fatal<P><p>[This message has been edited by Fatal Error (edited 08-02-2001).]||||reg||5
